                                Welcome to Savfox
                            Your AI coding assistant




  Update Model Permissions

› 1. Read Only (current)             Read files. Approval required for edits
                                     and internet access.
  2. Default (non-elevated sandbox)  Read/edit workspace files and run
                                     commands. Approval for internet/external.
  3. Full Access                     Full disk and internet access without
                                     approval prompts.

  The non-elevated sandbox protects your files and prevents network access under
  most circumstances. However, it carries greater risk if prompt injected. To
  upgrade to the elevated sandbox, run /setup-elevated-sandbox.
  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
